modified: 20210112204214632

<p>Collect tasks in the Inbox so you don't forget them, and get them out of your
  head quickly! Supports inline smart tokens like <code>@today</code>, <code>!1</code>–<code>!3</code>, <code>#Project</code>, and <code>@context</code>.</p>
<p>You can also press <kbd>{{$:/config/shortcuts/py-quick-capture}}</kbd> to
  capture from anywhere.</p>
